  "findings": [
    "Primary curated-route replay is ceilinged at 12/12 route-direction hits and 60/60 epistemic points; this cannot by itself distinguish proposal competence because the action set was curated.",
    "Unscaffolded replay still generated the core historical research direction in 12/12 cases, but only 9/12 top routes were historically admissible: two Atlantic-cable answers imported TDR and one Bessemer answer imported the later basic-dephosphorization route. At least one additional non-top cholera route imported modern chlorination/cluster-RCT language.",
    "TDR is a modern cable-fault technique; the replay therefore correctly reasoned about fault localization while selecting an unavailable intervention. Good epistemic operator does not imply world-admissible action.",
    "The affordance-bounded treatment preserves 12/12 core-route generation and removes the known future technologies from top routes, but exact manifest compliance is only 10/12 because two Atlantic-cable answers added hydrostatic-pressure simulation absent from the manifest.",
    "The Agent self-reported capability compliance in 12/12 bounded outputs while external adjudication found only 10/12 exact compliance. Capability self-attestation is not proof of capability compliance.",
    "Across all three treatments, action-space representation changes what the replay measures: curated routes test selection, free generation tests proposal but permits future-tool leakage, explicit capability manifests test bounded proposal and expose the need for external enforcement/verification."
  ],
  "worldModelUpdate": "Research competence decomposes into at least proposal quality, selection quality, action availability/admissibility, and verification of actual capability use. A research operator can be epistemically excellent yet physically/world-state invalid. The World must represent available affordances, and effective compliance cannot be inferred from the Agent claim that it complied.",
  "validityBoundary": "All historical replay remains calibration evidence because pretrained historical-memory leakage cannot be eliminated. The unscaffolded/affordance treatments improve discrimination of action-generation behavior but do not create a clean counterfactual nineteenth-century Agent."
}
